WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.147
Un pivoting turns repeated measure columns into rows.

00:00:04.147 --> 00:00:09.522
The wide source may have one row per product with several month columns.

00:00:09.522 --> 00:00:14.027
The long result will have a month column and a revenue column.

00:00:14.027 --> 00:00:19.007
One product row can expand into several product and month rows.

00:00:19.007 --> 00:00:24.831
So the grain changes from one row per product to one row per product and month.
